      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 48px 56px; background: #09090b; color: #fafafa; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #22d3ee;\">Rollout plan</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 34px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0;\">Four stages to a full warehouse rollout</h2><p style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #a1a1aa; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Each stage has an exit test; we only advance when the previous site hits it for two straight weeks.</p><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: stretch;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; border: 1px solid #fb923c; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fb923c;\">Stage 1</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fb923c; color: #1c1917;\">Now</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #fafafa;\">Pilot</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #a1a1aa;\">One dock team in Reno scans inbound pallets with the new app.</div></div><div style=\"flex: 1; border: 1px solid #22d3ee; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #22d3ee;\">Stage 2</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15); color: #22d3ee;\">Nov</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #fafafa;\">Site</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #a1a1aa;\">All shifts at Reno; paper manifests retired.</div></div><div style=\"flex: 1; border: 1px solid #34d399; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #34d399;\">Stage 3</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15); color: #34d399;\">Q1</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #fafafa;\">Region</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #a1a1aa;\">Reno, Boise and Salt Lake share one dashboard.</div></div><div style=\"flex: 1; border: 1px solid #52525b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #52525b;\">Stage 4</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: #27272a; color: #a1a1aa;\">Q2</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #fafafa;\">Network</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #a1a1aa;\">Twelve sites; the old WMS goes read-only.</div></div></div></div>"
